# BETK — actions / api / validation (auto)
Follow skill-api-architect.md + skill-zod-validator.md. Recommended model: Sonnet (build); Opus for security-sensitive paths.
- Order: authenticate → authorize (role/ownership) → Zod-validate → act → revalidate → typed result {ok,data} | {ok:false,error:{code,message,fields}}. RLS denial → NOT_FOUND (don't leak existence).
- Every action/route parses a Zod schema from src/validations BEFORE any DB call. Mirror DB constraints (phone E.164, rating 1-5, payout ≥ 100, ≤5 images/≤3 review photos/≤5 evidence/≤5 tags, service listings omit stock).
- Enforce the verified-phone transaction gate (OD-4) on checkout / become-seller / payout: require users.phone_number IS NOT NULL (Server Action AND RLS WITH CHECK); send Google-only users through phone+OTP at that point.
- No secrets in code/logs/URLs. Webhooks: signature-verified + idempotent.
